  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The FedoraOAIProvider class adds xmlns:xsi and xsi:schemaLocation attributes to oai_dc:dc nodes of DC streams' content:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "if ((dissURI.split(\"/\").length == 3) && (dissURI.endsWith(\"/DC\"))) {\n    // If it's a DC datastream dissemination, inject the\n    // xsi:schemaLocation attribute\n    xml = xml.replaceAll(\"<oai_dc:dc \", \"<oai_dc:dc \" + _XSI_DECLARATION + \" \" + _DC_SCHEMALOCATION + \" \");\n  }",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "However, if these attributes already exist, they are still added. An attribute can be specified only once for an XML element instance, hence the resulting document is invalid XML.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The code should check for existence of the xmlns:xsi and xmlns:schemaLocation attributes before adding them.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
