     "body": "<p>I can't upload an attachment (Unexpected server response) so I'll just paste the proposed patch inline here:</p>\n\n\n<p>&#8212; FedoraOAIDriver.java\t2008-07-29 14:55:18.000000000 +0200<br/>\n+++ FedoraOAIDriver.java\t2012-03-27 14:23:46.000000000 +0200<br/>\n@@ -280,7 +280,7 @@<br/>\n             }<br/>\n             String xml =<br/>\n                     buf.toString().replaceAll(\"\\\\s*&lt;\\\\?xml.<b>?\\\\?&gt;<br class=\"atl-forced-newline\" />s</b>\", \"\");</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>if ((dissURI.split(\"/\").length == 3) &amp;&amp; (dissURI.endsWith(\"/DC\"))) {<br/>\n+            if ((dissURI.split(\"/\").length == 3) &amp;&amp; dissURI.endsWith(\"/DC\") &amp;&amp; !xml.contains(_XSI_DECLARATION)) {<br/>\n                 // If it's a DC datastream dissemination, inject the<br/>\n                 // xsi:schemaLocation attribute<br/>\n                 xml =</li>\n</ul>\n",
